<title>INDIA: India RBI lowers cut-off at repo auction.</title>
<headline>India RBI lowers cut-off at repo auction.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said it lowered the cut-off rate to 4.0 percent at a repo auction on Friday from the previous cut-off of 4.05 percent.  </p>
<p>The RBI said it received four bids for 34.0 billion rupees of which it accepted one for 2.50 billion rupees.</p>
<p>The weighted average cut-off rate was 4.0 percent.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
